---

### ✔ Minimal end-to-end flow (MVP goal)

This is your first real milestone:

```text
Library.xml
→ ingest
→ SQLite storage
→ Spotify resolution
→ YouTube fallback
→ download audio
→ tag files
→ store archive
```

---

# 🎯 Definition of “Functional Application”

You are DONE when:

* You can feed in a Library.xml
* It fully parses without errors
* It stores everything in a database
* It resolves at least Spotify + YouTube
* It downloads at least one correct track
* It saves files in structured folders
* It can resume after interruption

